OL,3,AUnheard Oasis recordings up for sale
OL,4,
OL,5,FOasis fans are set for a Wonderwall
OL,6,Fexperience when they get the chance to
OL,7,Fbid for unheard recordings of the
OL,8,FSupersonic boys at their peak.
OL,10,FThe archive includes recordings of 63
OL,11,Flive shows, soundchecks and more than
OL,12,F100 hours of rehearsals from the band's
OL,13,Frise and rise in the 1990s.
OL,15,FThe lots, which also include original
OL,16,Fsetlists, tour itineraries, a
OL,17,Fband-played Epiphone guitar and an
OL,18,FOasis tour parka, will be offered for
OL,19,Fsale on 3 October in Evesham,
OL,20,FWorcestershire.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
