OL,3,AUnheard Oasis recordings up for sale
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe collection, known as The Desk
OL,6,FTapes, has been in the possession of
OL,7,FOwain Richards for 20 years, after his
OL,8,Fdad, a former front-of-house sound
OL,9,Fengineer joined the band's crew during
OL,10,Ftheir heyday.
